&lt;li&gt;Collaborating closely with Product, Design, and ML engineering teams to turn a fast-moving AI product roadmap into intuitive, reliable software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building the full stack of these experiences, from dashboard UI down to the APIs and services that connect the Braze platform to our ML pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading efforts in web application architecture to ensure scalability, maintainability, and performance across our platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing Braze’s product strategy and roadmap by providing technical insights and driving innovation in user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring engineers, providing guidance on technical growth, and fostering a high-performance engineering culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting teams implementing Braze’s AI solutions to ensure customer success and facilitate effective collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
